### enumerate

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl enumerate forall dim {int; number} t. (ar : a dim t) : a dim (convert.unativeint * t) =\n    inl (a ar) = ar\n    ar\n    |> am'.to_vec\n    |> into_iter\n    |> enumerate\n    |> iter_collect\n    |> am'.vec_map' from_pair\n    |> am'.from_vec","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl enumerate forall dim {int; number} t. (ar : a dim t) : a dim (convert.unativeint * t) =
      inl (a ar) = ar
      ar
      |> am'.to_vec
      |> into_iter
      |> enumerate
      |> iter_collect
      |> am'.vec_map' from_pair
      |> am'.from_vec
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"///- --test\n///> rust\n\nam'.init_series 0i32 2 1\n|> fun x => a x : _ int _\n|> enumerate\n|> fun (a x : _ int _) => x\n|> _assert_eq' ;[ convert.convert 0i32, 0; convert.convert 1i32, 1; convert.convert 2i32, 2 ]","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  ///- --test
  ///> rust

  am'.init_series 0i32 2 1
  |> fun x => a x : _ int _
  |> enumerate
  |> fun (a x : _ int _) => x
  |> _assert_eq' ;[ convert.convert 0i32, 0; convert.convert 1i32, 1; convert.convert 2i32, 2 ]
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```
